          <h5 class="card-title">Superior Customer Service</h5>
    
          <ul><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:18px;" data-list-item-id="e34782150dd7969a8b2a0835f3a61ad89"><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-family:FoundersGrotesk-Web-Light;">Direct access to Trading Operations team</span></span></li><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:18px;" data-list-item-id="e19f72c3516933d15ea6573f7ddfaa52c"><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-family:FoundersGrotesk-Web-Light;">Streamlined operating structure creates efficiencies for our members&nbsp;</span></span></li><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:18px;" data-list-item-id="e33904892c9662223f9dee6396e0c8128"><span style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-family:FoundersGrotesk-Web-Light;">Institutional commitment to integrity and transparency</span></span></li></ul>
