    <p class="copy">MIAX® operates eight exchanges, offering access to U.S. multi-list options and equities through MIAX Exchange Group, U.S. futures through MIAX Futures®, and access to international capital markets through The Bermuda Stock Exchange (BSX) and The International Stock Exchange (TISE).</p>
